  "website": "https://www.pickyourown.org/AME2email.php?ADDT=UPDN&amp;EN=Floral+Acres&amp;ES=WV&amp;EC=Upshur+County&amp;EP=+304-924-6462&amp;ECT=French+Creek&amp;EZ=26218&amp;EA=RR+1+Box+26E&amp;EA2=&amp;EW=https%3A%2F%2Ffloralacresblueberryfarm.com&amp;RD=RD&amp;EF=&amp;EM=dinah%40floralacres.com&amp;EX=US&amp;PG=WVmountaineer.htm&amp;OP=No+match+%3B+&amp;IG=&amp;TW=&amp;DS=.+Our+focus+now+at+Floral+Acres+is+our+U-Pick+blueberry+operation.+Because+we+have+so+many+bushes%2C+with+lots+of+different+varieties%3B+the+season+is+long.+These+blueberries+are+organic%2C+as+the+only+thing+we+do+to+them+is+fertilize+the+ground%2C+and+mow+the+grass.+We+furnish+buckets+for+picking+and+ice+water+-+but+you+might+want+to+bring+your+own+straw+hat+for+those+hot+summer+days.+Comments+from+a+visitor+on+July+06%2C+2010%3A+%22The+owner+is+very+sweet+and+helpful%2C+they+have+been+in+business+for+a+while+and+know+what+they+are+doing.+However%2C+you+are+better+off+to+show+up+earlier+in+the+season+rather+than+later.+We+came+one+year+in+mid+August%2C+and+while+we+did+manage+to+pick+berries%2C+there+were+much+less+than+when+we+go+in+July.+They+raise+all+of+their+blueberries+with+organic+practices.+They+used+to+do+daylilies+but+are+getting+out+of+those+and+are+more+focused+on+blueberries.+The+farm+is+located+less+than+a+mile+from+the+French+Creek+Game+Farm%2C+so+it+could+be+made+into+a+good+family+outing+of+...&amp;DR=+",
